    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="ch4subch6">

                <pb facs="0301" n="289" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg289"/>

                <head>Proposal by the United States for an air transport agreement with India<anchor
                        n="97" xml:id="ch4subch6-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>[Discussions for the negotiation of a bilateral air transport agreement with
                    India were initiated by the United States in 1945, with inconclusive results.
                    Documentation regarding this subject is in Department of State File No.
                    711.4527.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
